openjev
================

This product is based on @typesafe-ai/typesafe-sdk-python (MIT), the official
TypeSafe AI Python SDK:

    https://github.com/typesafe-ai/typesafe-sdk-python

openjev is an independent, rebranded fork distributed under the same
MIT License (see the LICENSE file). It is kept wire-compatible with the TypeSafe
System One /v1 API so that a single client works unchanged against both the hosted
TypeSafe AI API (https://api.typesafe.ai) and a self-hosted openjev deployment
that implements the same /v1/systemone contract.

